      "text": [
        "New",
        "Solve the complex tickets that need engineering.",
        "Refunds, cancellations, renewal quotes, log investigation. Each one is a playbook that checks your systems, decides against your policy, and takes the action.",
        "Multi-subscription refund",
        "Refund request → verify identity, evaluate every subscription against policy, refund the eligible ones and explain the rest in the same reply.",
        "MFA reset & risk-lock release",
        "Can't authenticate → verify by text, confirm against the identity record, issue the enrolment reset link or release the risk lock — on chat and phone alike.",
        "Log collection & pre-triage",
        "Technical case → identify the environment, pull the logs, run first-pass analysis against known signatures, attach the diagnosis before a human opens it.",
        "Connect your systems in minutes."
      ]
    },
